WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Welcome to OpsCrew, an autonomous multi-agent copilot for enterprise operations,
developed for the AI Builder Cup 2026.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:23.500
Traditional expense exception auditing suffers from forty-eight-hour backlogs,
manual spreadsheets, and fragmented compliance policies.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:35.000
OpsCrew solves this with three specialized Gemini agents:
a Fact Extractor, a Policy Planner, and an Adversarial Reviewer.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:49.500
Our deterministic rule engine enforces policies SYN-001 through SYN-008,
preventing AI hallucinations and unverified payouts.

00:00:49.500 --> 00:01:03.000
In the live web app, operators see under fifteen seconds cloud deliberation replacing 48-hour manual backlogs,
one hundred percent auditability, and modeled annual savings.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:16.000
Here we inspect synthetic scenario DEV-04: a thirty-eight-dollar expense with a missing receipt hitting clause SYN-004 for evidence requests,
featuring multimodal drag-and-drop intake.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:28.000
Running the workflow invokes Gemini. Facts are hashed,
the Planner requests receipt proof, and the Reviewer validates rule compliance.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:41.000
With a PASS verdict, OpsCrew generates an interactive pre-draft notice citing SYN-004,
ready for one-click dispatch without authorizing payout.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:51.500
Strict governance requires explicit human review.
The operator inspects the plan and confirms the case with a single click.

00:01:51.500 --> 00:02:02.000
The server atomically commits the approval and audit trail to Google Cloud Firestore Native,
backed by idempotent key binding.

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:14.000
OpsCrew is verified by two hundred thirty-two automated tests with zero failures,
including offline evaluation and security guardrails.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:25.000
With a strict forty-dollar monthly budget guardrail and fail-closed admission,
OpsCrew delivers extraordinary return on investment.

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:36.500
Deployed on Google Cloud Run in US-Central-1 with Secret Manager credential isolation,
OpsCrew is secure and containerized.

00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:48.000
OpsCrew combines autonomous AI with deterministic enterprise safety.
We invite you to test our live deployment at opscrew-883881551915.us-central1.run.app.
